# <type>: <short summary>

# Types:
# feat      A new capability or user-visible behavior
# fix       A bug fix
# docs      Documentation-only changes
# style     Formatting or styling-only changes
# refactor  Code restructuring without behavior change
# test      Tests or test infrastructure
# chore     Tooling, config, repo maintenance

# Body:
# - What changed?
# - Why did it change?
# - What tradeoffs or follow-ups remain?

# Verification:
# - [ ] Typecheck
# - [ ] Tests
# - [ ] Build
# - [ ] Accessibility/visual check
# - [ ] Not applicable

